[2026-02-04T17:13:15.754Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T3Wz5JdxNxKRrRxghoeFL9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Trump administration 16 pharmaceutical companies pricing deals 2026 drug prices NPR\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/16/nx-s1-5678915/trumprx-pharma-drug-price-deals-list-prices\"},{\"title\":\"Pharma Companies Raise List Prices, Including 16 That Had Agreements to Lower Prices with Trump Administration: Report | PharmExec\",\"url\":\"https://www.pharmexec.com/view/companies-raise-list-prices-16-agreements-lower-prices-trump-administration-report\"},{\"title\":\"Many brand-name drug prices are going up, despite Trump administration deals : NPR\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/14/nx-s1-5669401/many-brand-name-drug-prices-are-going-up-despite-trump-administration-deals\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | WVIK, Quad Cities NPR\",\"url\":\"https://www.wvik.org/npr-top-stories/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | NPR Illinois\",\"url\":\"https://www.nprillinois.org/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | NPR & Houston Public Media\",\"url\":\"https://www.houstonpublicmedia.org/npr/2026/01/16/nx-s1-5678915/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year/\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | Jefferson Public Radio\",\"url\":\"https://www.ijpr.org/npr-news/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | STLPR\",\"url\":\"https://www.stlpr.org/npr/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | WBOI - NPR News & Diverse Music in Northeast Indiana\",\"url\":\"https://www.wboi.org/npr-news/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | KPBS Public Media\",\"url\":\"https://www.kpbs.org/news/health/2026/01/16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what NPR reported about the Trump administration's deals with pharmaceutical companies:\n\n## Trump Administration Drug Pricing Deals\n\nSince September, 16 major drug companies have inked deals with the Trump administration to lower prices. Pfizer was the first of 16 companies to announce a deal with the Trump administration, but the details remain under wraps.\n\n### The Deals' Components\nThe 16 companies made deals in exchange for a break on certain tariffs. The deals vary but include discounts on some drugs available to people paying cash, that is, not using their health insurance.\n\nThe deals also included pledges for future drugs to be launched at the same price in other wealthy countries as in the U.S. And some drugs will be made available at a discount to cash-paying customers through a new website called TrumpRx.gov.\n\n### Drug Prices Still Rising\nDespite these deals, drug companies, including the 16 that made deals, raised the prices of 872 brand-name drugs in the first two weeks of 2026, according to a new analysis by 46brooklyn, a drug price research firm. All 16 drug companies that inked deals with the Trump administration still raised some of their prices for 2026.\n\nThe drugs with price hikes included medicines to treat cancer, heart failure and Type 2 diabetes. The price of some COVID shots also went up.\n\nThe price increases came in at a median of 4% — the same as last year — despite the deals announced with fanfare by the Trump administration.\n\n### Specific Company Examples\nPfizer, which reached the first deal with the Trump administration in September, raised the prices of 72 products in January. They include a 15% increase on the price of its COVID shot.\n\nMerck also raised prices on 18 products, including Isentress for HIV and Belsomra for insomnia, according to 46brooklyn's data.\n\n### Expert Analysis\n\"Those deals probably are not very important in terms of manufacturer drug pricing and the prices paid by most Americans for prescription drugs,\" says Dr. Ben Rome, a health policy researcher at Brigham and Women's Hospital.\n\nDetails are hard to come by since the administration's deal documents haven't been made public. During the press conferences, health and White House officials mentioned the companies had made commitments for Medicaid discounts — but that's something the program already gets.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"7ee9732e-d96f-4490-88f5-8241c170a838","tool_use_result":{"query":"Trump administration 16 pharmaceutical companies pricing deals 2026 drug prices NPR","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01HP1bMChXX2PMy4VueNSyrh","content":[{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year","url":"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/16/nx-s1-5678915/trumprx-pharma-drug-price-deals-list-prices"},{"title":"Pharma Companies Raise List Prices, Including 16 That Had Agreements to Lower Prices with Trump Administration: Report | PharmExec","url":"https://www.pharmexec.com/view/companies-raise-list-prices-16-agreements-lower-prices-trump-administration-report"},{"title":"Many brand-name drug prices are going up, despite Trump administration deals : NPR","url":"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/14/nx-s1-5669401/many-brand-name-drug-prices-are-going-up-despite-trump-administration-deals"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | WVIK, Quad Cities NPR","url":"https://www.wvik.org/npr-top-stories/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | NPR Illinois","url":"https://www.nprillinois.org/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | NPR & Houston Public Media","url":"https://www.houstonpublicmedia.org/npr/2026/01/16/nx-s1-5678915/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year/"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | Jefferson Public Radio","url":"https://www.ijpr.org/npr-news/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | STLPR","url":"https://www.stlpr.org/npr/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | WBOI - NPR News & Diverse Music in Northeast Indiana","url":"https://www.wboi.org/npr-news/2026-01-16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year"},{"title":"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year | KPBS Public Media","url":"https://www.kpbs.org/news/health/2026/01/16/trump-struck-deals-with-16-drug-companies-but-theyre-still-raising-prices-this-year"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what NPR reported about the Trump administration's deals with pharmaceutical companies:\n\n## Trump Administration Drug Pricing Deals\n\nSince September, 16 major drug companies have inked deals with the Trump administration to lower prices. Pfizer was the first of 16 companies to announce a deal with the Trump administration, but the details remain under wraps.\n\n### The Deals' Components\nThe 16 companies made deals in exchange for a break on certain tariffs. The deals vary but include discounts on some drugs available to people paying cash, that is, not using their health insurance.\n\nThe deals also included pledges for future drugs to be launched at the same price in other wealthy countries as in the U.S. And some drugs will be made available at a discount to cash-paying customers through a new website called TrumpRx.gov.\n\n### Drug Prices Still Rising\nDespite these deals, drug companies, including the 16 that made deals, raised the prices of 872 brand-name drugs in the first two weeks of 2026, according to a new analysis by 46brooklyn, a drug price research firm. All 16 drug companies that inked deals with the Trump administration still raised some of their prices for 2026.\n\nThe drugs with price hikes included medicines to treat cancer, heart failure and Type 2 diabetes. The price of some COVID shots also went up.\n\nThe price increases came in at a median of 4% — the same as last year — despite the deals announced with fanfare by the Trump administration.\n\n### Specific Company Examples\nPfizer, which reached the first deal with the Trump administration in September, raised the prices of 72 products in January. They include a 15% increase on the price of its COVID shot.\n\nMerck also raised prices on 18 products, including Isentress for HIV and Belsomra for insomnia, according to 46brooklyn's data.\n\n### Expert Analysis\n\"Those deals probably are not very important in terms of manufacturer drug pricing and the prices paid by most Americans for prescription drugs,\" says Dr. Ben Rome, a health policy researcher at Brigham and Women's Hospital.\n\nDetails are hard to come by since the administration's deal documents haven't been made public. During the press conferences, health and White House officials mentioned the companies had made commitments for Medicaid discounts — but that's something the program already gets."],"durationSeconds":14.7526834}}
[2026-02-04T17:13:23.461Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Js5e41uREz1CgkbNhwBqCH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"drug price increases January 2026 brand name medications pharmaceutical\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Drugmakers raise US prices on 350 medicines despite pressure from Trump | CNN\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnn.com/2026/01/01/health/drug-price-increases-2026\"},{\"title\":\"List of Medications and Vaccines Increasing in Price in 2026 - Newsweek\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsweek.com/medications-drugs-vaccines-price-increases-2026-11290128\"},{\"title\":\"Pharma Companies Raise List Prices, Including 16 That Had Agreements to Lower Prices with Trump Administration: Report | PharmExec\",\"url\":\"https://www.pharmexec.com/view/companies-raise-list-prices-16-agreements-lower-prices-trump-administration-report\"},{\"title\":\"Trump struck deals with 16 drug companies. But they're still raising prices this year\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/16/nx-s1-5678915/trumprx-pharma-drug-price-deals-list-prices\"},{\"title\":\"CSRxP: BIG PHARMA RINGS IN 2026 WITH MORE THAN 300 PRICE INCREASES ON BRAND NAME DRUGS, OUTPACING START OF 2025 - CSRxP\",\"url\":\"https://www.csrxp.org/csrxp-big-pharma-rings-in-2026-with-more-than-300-price-increases-on-brand-name-drugs-outpacing-start-of-2025/\"},{\"title\":\"Pfizer Leads Industry-Wide Surge in Drug Prices for 2026 Despite Political Pressure - BioSpace\",\"url\":\"https://www.biospace.com/business/pfizer-leads-industry-wide-surge-in-drug-prices-for-2026-despite-political-pressure\"},{\"title\":\"Many brand-name drug prices are going up, despite Trump administration deals : NPR\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/14/nx-s1-5669401/many-brand-name-drug-prices-are-going-up-despite-trump-administration-deals\"},{\"title\":\"Drugmakers plan to raise US prices on at least 350 medications: Report\",\"url\":\"https://thehill.com/policy/healthcare/5668053-us-drug-prices-rise-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Drug companies sign \\\"Most Favored Nation\\\" deals, then raise prices anyway\",\"url\":\"https://www.drugdiscoverytrends.com/drug-companies-sign-most-favored-nation-deals-then-raise-prices-anyway/\"},{\"title\":\"Drug Prices Rising on 350 Medications | 2026 Insights\",\"url\":\"https://tomorrowinvestor.com/drugmakers-raise-prices-on-350-medicines-despite-trump-pressure/40641/\"}]\n\nBased on my search, here's what I found about drug price increases in January 2026 for brand name medications:\n\n## Drug Price Increases in January 2026\n\nDrugmakers planned to raise U.S. prices on at least 350 branded medications including vaccines against COVID, RSV and shingles and blockbuster cancer treatment Ibrance, even as the Trump administration pressured them for cuts.\n\n### Scale of Increases\n- According to an analysis from 46brooklyn, drug companies hiked up the price of 872 different brand name medications over the first two weeks of 2026, ranging from COVID vaccine shots to treatments for cancer, Type 2 diabetes, cardiovascular disease, and more.\n- The number of price increases for 2026 is up from the same point last year, when drugmakers unveiled plans for raises on more than 250 drugs.\n- The median of this year's price hikes is around 4% - in line with 2025. The increases do not reflect any rebates to pharmacy benefit managers and other discounts.\n\n### Key Companies and Drugs Affected\n\n**Pfizer:**\n- Pfizer, which reached the first deal with the Trump administration in September, raised the prices of 72 products in January, including a 15% increase on the price of its COVID shot.\n- Pfizer drugs that will cost more this year include the cancer medicine Ibrance, migraine pill Nurtec and COVID-19 therapy Paxlovid.\n\n**GSK:**\n- GSK, which sells a shingles vaccine and competes with Pfizer for the RSV market, reportedly plans to increase prices on around 20 products by 2% to 8.9%.\n\n**Other Companies:**\n- Merck also raised prices on 18 products, including Isentress for HIV and Belsomra for insomnia.\n- Pfizer, Sanofi, Boehringer Ingelheim, Novartis and GSK are among those companies and also plan to raise prices on some drugs on January 1.\n\n### Price Cuts\nDrugmakers also plan to cut the list prices on around nine drugs. That includes a more than 40% cut for Boehringer Ingelheim's diabetes drug Jardiance and three related treatments. Jardiance is among the 10 drugs for which the U.S. government negotiated a lower price for the Medicare program for people aged 65 and older in 2026.\n\n### Trump Administration Response\nAll 16 drug companies that inked deals with the Trump administration over the past few months still raised some of their prices for 2026. Biden's Inflation Reduction Act of 2022 created a legally enforceable framework with published negotiated prices, specific drugs and statutory penalties for non-compliance. Trump's MFN deals are voluntary.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"27f58dfb-6e5c-4e0d-ad7f-aaa7b0c3b8bc","tool_use_result":{"query":"drug price increases January 2026 brand name medications pharmaceutical","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011pLnf6JMUngspdRn58AFfy","content":[{"title":"Drugmakers raise US prices on 350 medicines despite pressure from Trump | CNN","url":"https://www.cnn.com/2026/01/01/health/drug-price-increases-2026"},{"title":"List of Medications and Vaccines Increasing in Price in 2026 - Newsweek","url":"https://www.newsweek.com/medications-drugs-vaccines-price-increases-2026-11290128"},{"title":"Pharma Companies Raise List Prices, Including 16 That Had Agreements to Lower Prices with Trump Administration: Report | PharmExec","url":"https://www.pharmexec.com/view/companies-raise-list-prices-16-agreements-lower-prices-trump-administration-report"},{"title":"Trump struck dea